  "calculation": {
    "expression": "median_center(-rolling_sum(return,3) * rolling_mean(2*max(lagged_bearish_breadth-0.5,0),20))",
    "description": "For each tradable instrument, negate its trailing 3-day return and scale it by a lagged, continuously varying market bearish-breadth intensity. Bearish breadth is the fraction of available instruments with negative daily returns; the intensity is the 20-day mean of twice its excess over 50%. The resulting cross-section is median centered. All regime inputs are lagged to avoid look-ahead."
